Draw.io icon packs
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  skills/arkitect-drawio/assets/libraries/*.drawio

Eighteen libraries, about 4,725 marks, built from the sources pinned in

  skills/arkitect-drawio/assets/libraries/sources.json

Per-source terms, exact versions and archive hashes are recorded in

  skills/arkitect-drawio/assets/libraries/ATTRIBUTION.md

Two different kinds of terms apply, and conflating them would be a mistake.

PERMISSIONS, not licences. Amazon, Microsoft and Google publish icon sets for
drawing architecture diagrams, permit copying, distribution and display for
that purpose, and reserve every other right - including the right to withdraw
permission. Icon shape must not be altered, which is why this repository
embeds vendor artwork byte-for-byte with no optimisation pass.

  aws     243 icons   AWS Architecture Icons
                      https://aws.amazon.com/architecture/icons/
                      subject also to the AWS Trademark Guidelines at
                      https://aws.amazon.com/trademark-guidelines/
