Excalidraw libraries
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  skills/arkitect-excalidraw/assets/libraries/bundled/*.excalidrawlib

36 libraries, 1,162 items, obtained from the public Excalidraw library
catalogue at

  https://libraries.excalidraw.com/

Each library belongs to its author and remains under the licence its author
published it under. Every library, its author and its item count are listed in

  skills/arkitect-excalidraw/assets/libraries/bundled/ATTRIBUTION.md

They are committed here so that a diagram can be drawn offline and so that the
same product always gets the same mark. Follow the catalogue link before
reusing a library outside a diagram.

Several libraries contain vendor marks - Microsoft Azure, Google Cloud,
Snowflake, and others. Those marks belong to their respective owners and are
used only to label the products they represent.

