Product logos
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Logos fetched at your request by `arkitect drawio logo` or
`arkitect excalidraw make-icon` are cached under
`skills/*/assets/{logos,icons}/` and are deliberately NOT committed to this
repository. Each such logo remains the trademark of its owner, is fetched from a
source you name, and is used only to label the product it belongs to.
